    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsubiriye kwunamura amaso, mbona imbere yanje imikogote ine isokoroka ivuye hagati y’imisozi ibiri, kandi iyo misozi yari imisozi y’umwakaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukogote wa mbere wakwegwa n’amafarasi y’akagajo, uwa kabiri wakwegwa n’ayirabura, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uwa gatatu wakwegwa n’ayera, uwa kane na wo wakwegwa n’ayafise amabara menshi, kandi yose yari afise inkomezi nyinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaza wa mumarayika yavugana nanje nti: “Ivyo ni ibiki ga mwami wanje?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa mumarayika aranyishura ati: “Izo ni impwemu zine zo mw’ijuru, zisohotse ziva aho zama zihagaze imbere y’Umwami aganza isi yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urya mukogote ufise amafarasi yirabura ugiye werekeye igihugu co mu buraruko, uw’amafarasi yera werekeye mu burengero, uw’amafarasi afise amabara menshi na wo werekeye mu bumanuko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihe ayo mafarasi y’inkomezi nyinshi yasohoka, yashaka kugendagenda mw’isi yose. Maze uwo mumarayika aca avuga ati: “Nimugendagende mw’isi yose!” Nuko aca agenda kugenzura isi yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze uwo mumarayika arampamagara ati: “Raba, amwe agiye yerekeye mu gihugu co mu buraruko gusukayo uburake bwanje bituma umutima wanje uruhuka ku vy’igihugu co mu buraruko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rirambwira riti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niwakire ifeza n’inzahabu ku bari barajanywe ari inyagano ari bo Heludayi, Tobiya na Yedaya, bashitse bavuye i Babiloni. Ugende uwo musi nyene kwa Yosiya mwene Zefaniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ujane za feza na za nzahabu ucure urugori maze urwambike Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki, umuherezi mukuru, ku mutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umubwire uti uku ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Ehe umuntu yitwa Shami araje, kandi azoshamikira mu kibanza ciwe maze yubake urusengero rw’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni we azokwubaka urusengero rw’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", azokwambikwa icubahiro c’inganji maze yicare ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami aganze. Ari ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami, azoba n’umuherezi, kandi ayo mabanga yiwe abiri azoyahuza neza mu rutonde ntangere.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urwo rugori ruzobwa Heludayi, Tobiya, Yedaya na Heni mwene Zefaniya nk’icibutso mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abari kure bazoza bafashe kwubaka urusengero rw’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", maze muzomenya ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose yabantumyeko. Ivyo bizoba nimwagira umwete wo kwumvira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
